      "fp.voice-logging.stepsTitle": "Four seconds of talking, <em class=\"accent\">nothing else</em>.",
      "fp.voice-logging.stepsSub": "The whole point is that you do not have to change how you describe food. Say it the way you would say it to a person.",
      "fp.voice-logging.getKicker": "What you get",
      "fp.voice-logging.getTitle": "A full entry, not a rough note.",
      "fp.voice-logging.getSub": "Voice logging produces exactly what a photo scan produces — an itemised, editable meal with real numbers behind it.",
